  "scope": "Reject the proven carnitinamide alias and retire seven proven different-substance generated aliases; retain unresolved DL-carnitine as historical provenance, preserve all other rows and positions, and grant no mapping or role approval. The blocked issue901 melezitose proposal is excluded and its original bytes restored.",
